# "daynight cycle" - 103s video: dia 0-15s, noite 15-86s, amanhecer 87s+
# 96bpm: dia_intro 24 beats=15s; noite 112 beats=70s; amanhecer começa no beat 136 (~85s)
tempo 96

track pad pad_dark
automate cutoff 0 1900 -> 24 520 curve exp -> 112 620 -> 136 900 curve log -> 160 2600 curve log
track glass pad_glass
automate morph 0 20% -> 24 65% curve exp -> 136 55% -> 160 15% curve exp
track ris dawn_riser
automate cutoff 132 500 -> 148 7200 curve log -> 164 3200 curve exp
automate bright 132 0.05 -> 148 0.92 curve log -> 164 0.35 curve exp
track kal kalimba
swing 56
humanize 8ms 10%
track ep epiano_fm
humanize 7ms 8%
track hp harp
humanize 8ms 10%
track fl flute_lead
humanize 10ms 8%
track sb subbass
set drv 0.22
track shk shaker
swing 56
track ht hat_closed
swing 56
track bell night_ping
humanize 12ms 12%
track kick kick_deep

